<title>HONG KONG: Allied Group 1996 net jumps 130 percent.</title>
<headline>Allied Group 1996 net jumps 130 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	10.2	  vs 4.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     171.65 gain vs 6.63 gain</p>
<p>    Net			 312.24	vs 135.62</p>
<p>    Turnover		  745.89	vs 552.02</p>
<p>    Company name	    Allied Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Allied Group is a corporate management and property development group.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$131.21 million on deemed disposal of an interest in a subsidiary arising from the placement of shares in the subsidiary to a third party and gain of HK$40.44 million on disposal of interest in subsidiaries and associated companies.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
